# Keep the build context to sources. A copied build/ directory carries a
# CMakeCache.txt that records the path it was generated in, and CMake then
# refuses to configure in the image: "The current CMakeCache.txt directory ...
# is different than the directory ... where CMakeCache.txt was created."
# The image build must not depend on what happens to sit in the working tree.
build/
.git/
docs/site/
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
*.grf
*.iso
*.gcm
